## Phase 0.1: RHI lifecycle and capability gating
Docs: [Architecture Overview](../planning/architecture-overview.md), [Driver Backends](../planning/subsystems/driver-backends.md)
- [ ] Define RHI init/shutdown ownership and driver lifecycle boundaries.
- [ ] Wire the RHI facade to own driver, resource manager, and frame counters.
- [ ] Implement capability query and gating plumbing for limits and feature flags.

## Phase 0.2: Command model scaffolding
Docs: [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md)
- [ ] Define the command list submission boundary and frame counters.
- [ ] Ensure commands execute through `IRHICommandContext` with pipeline selection.
- [ ] Define per-thread command allocator ownership and reset policy.

## Phase 0.3: Resource system baseline
Docs: [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md), [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md)
- [ ] Define resource descriptors with explicit initial access state.
- [ ] Establish deferred destruction queues and fence/epoch tracking.
- [ ] Specify pooled allocator interfaces and transient aliasing policy.
- [ ] Define resource debug naming conventions for diagnostics.
- [ ] Implement debug name propagation to backend objects and diagnostics.

## Phase 0.4: Diagnostics baseline
Docs: [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)
- [ ] Define validation severity levels and reporting surface.
- [ ] Add debug marker/event APIs with build/runtime gating.
- [ ] Establish GPU crash capture hooks (backend capability-gated).
